{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_014_01_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:80a5ba49b1a90b0aa25f0e70ceb447990d45bf635636cd8e444c673ec4ffe6ce",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_i:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d3f595cf089fff702f7407b539694929da2864b21babbe21110a3108ca22a29",
      "text": "好，得赶快换衣服了。\n离化妆师来的时间只剩一点点了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_i:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24843045253ce9dad6ae571ef7e8899ffb7aa3ee782ec3be6797a41fed140285",
      "text": "……手在发抖，果然还是在紧张吧。\n……啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_i:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5c45e7a3223ad72fdada00ffb357115f023467d977d3b5369d9bd503b299a77",
      "text": "胸垫，啊……\n随身带着这东西，今天也是最后一天了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_i:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e411b437ff81fed7b569c77865f4e49af8e9192132d0d410a64ef5ce061c21a4",
      "text": "放在包里明明是理所当然的事情呢。\n呵呵，感觉真不可思议。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_i:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7be86f0170c882732d34e019e6a759faceb59b9816a43742ff5c670720e11264",
      "text": "回想起来，经历了不少事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_i:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33e3147f4da3612f08058d13073049f0c3982aa2357471616698ea771bfc8c04",
      "text": "（明明想成为帅气的男性偶像，\n却稀里糊涂地当上了女性偶像）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_i:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea20ed1afcb6f48823cbbc535c76157e4730c1772c4170dcfcf9c87daf8fc274",
      "text": "（突然被要求穿着女装在街上走，\n还挑战了泳装拍摄……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_i:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2cf72230c9e12ad1ba28fccea7a9e059059ecb9f36d1e05ae7f67a5645a577f",
      "text": "（净是些作为男性偶像的话，\n绝对不会去做的事情）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_i:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36e47cc5754fb0bf1e0629563fb84f46a5f6de2e89c4323cb1f15b01ddbcf36e",
      "text": "啊哈哈……忍耐过各种各样的考验呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_i:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d0848d72a676d7b7034cc9c117731d9a5328742b3a5b7ed9e31d19458d5e868",
      "text": "（隐瞒性别虽然很辛苦，\n但现在想想也许也是不错的经验）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
